NO REDISTRIBUTED THIRD-PARTY CONTENT

The unit list in `examples/` is derived from a synthetic case study carried in
the authors' own private tree. No number here is a fact about a real
organisation, no person named is a real person, and the reporting lines are
invented in full -- the source carried none, which is the first thing this
audit reports about it.

`battery/make_series.py` generates capture series and they are not committed.
They exist to measure where each axiom arm starts answering, which is a fact
about the engine; a finding produced by a generated series is never evidence
about an organisation, and `docs/burn-in.md` says so where the numbers are.

